	(text "A BF350 on top of each 6061 bar, one underneath: a half bridge.\nWired top-to-EXC+ on all three: pressing lowers the midpoint (sign -1).\nR904/R905: 2 x 350R matched, or a dummy BF350 pair on an offcut."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 195.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fad9ac3b-cbcc-44d1-8be0-42a16e3bcd07")
	)
	(text "FILTERS AND THE SUM"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 110.49 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c68cf3c0-24af-47bb-b8a9-84511bf21cd6")
	)
	(text "1k in series, 4n7 (C0G) to GND per input; 47n each foot to MC.\nS = the mean of the filtered mids: 47k each, 10n S-MC, 1n S-GND.\n47k, not 10k: ~1.3 % of a foot leaks into the others (10k: ~6 %)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 110.49 195.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
